<title>USA: NetVantage completes testing on Coyote circuit.</title>
<headline>NetVantage completes testing on Coyote circuit.</headline>
<dateline>EL SEGUNDO, Calif. 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>NetVantage Inc on Monday said it completed development and testing of its first application-specific integrated circuit, known as the Coyote.</p>
<p>In a statement, the company said quantity shipments of Coyote-based products will start in early February of 1997.</p>
<p>NetVantage develops, manufactures and markets Ethernet workgroup switches designed to increase the information-handling capacity of local area networks.</p>
</text>
